 "paragraphs": [
  "Aliya, Zade and the young falcon looked around. “We have to count the bubbler crabs,” Zade figured out.",
  "They put aside one shell for each crab but Zade became worried. “There are so many crabs. I keep losing count.”",
  "Aliya had an idea. “How about we replace every 10 shells with 1 twig? This way, we will be able to count faster and remember our total.”"
 ],
